+---
+name: finance-active-customer
+description: what "active customer" means in the finance reporting views (developer statement, unconfirmed)
+type: context
+scope: finance reporting views, Views/rpt.vwFinance*.sql and new finance views
+status: suspected
+last-verified: never
+---
+In the finance reporting views, a customer counts as active in a month when it has at least one `fact.FactSales` row with `NetAmount` above zero in the 12 months ending with that month, the month included. The CRM flag `dim.DimCustomerCrm.IsActive` is a different definition, used for marketing audiences, and the two counts differ.
+**Confidence:** declared
+**Provenance:** developer statement, 2026-11-18, made while correcting a finance view in a session; not confirmed by a business owner
+**Evidence:** none in the code; this repository computes no active-customer measure
+**Counterevidence / exceptions:** applies to the finance reporting views only; other reports may define the term differently
+**Dependencies / unresolved:** the finance report owner has not confirmed the definition
+**Verify by:** ask the finance report owner; the code cannot show it
+**Semantic refresh:** trigger: a change to a finance view or a statement from the finance report owner; result: not yet rechecked
+**Draft status:** draft pending PR review; not team-approved policy
